<tr><td class="pad" style="padding:44px 44px 6px;"><p style="margin:0 0 22px;font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2.5px;color:#A14826;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;"><span style="display:inline-block;width:26px;height:1px;background-color:#A14826;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:12px;"></span>The workshop &amp; the masterclass</p><h1 class="h1" style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:42px;line-height:1.12;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 28px;">An hour of honesty, <em style="font-family:''Cormorant Garamond'',Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:500;font-size:1.05em;color:#C9603A;">at half price.</em></h1><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 16px;">Hello {{ subscriber.first_name | default: "there" }},</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 16px;">I don&rsquo;t do much with Black Friday. This year I&rsquo;m using it for one thing: the first step.</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 16px;">Maybe you have been reading these emails for a while and have never made a sound with us. That&rsquo;s fine. The first sound is the longest.</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 16px;">The workshop is seventy minutes, live on Zoom. It is not singing, and nobody performs. You ask a question your mind can&rsquo;t answer first, you breathe in, and you let your body make one tone: the tone of what&rsquo;s there, right now. You don&rsquo;t need a good voice. You need an honest one.</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 0px;">From today through Monday 30&nbsp;November, a seat is half price. So is the masterclass, the longer session for people who work with people.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td class="pad" style="padding:34px 44px 6px;"><h2 class="offer-h" style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:27px;line-height:1.22;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 18px;">What happens in <em style="font-family:''Cormorant Garamond'',Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:500;font-size:1.05em;color:#C9603A;">seventy minutes</em></h2><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-bottom:1px solid #E2D5C1;"><tr><td style="padding:14px 0 15px;border-top:1px solid #E2D5C1;"><p style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.35;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 5px;">An introduction to Somatic Vocal Healing</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#4A3848;margin:0;">The method where sound becomes the language of the body: a closer connection to your body, your own sound, and whatever wants to show up underneath.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:14px 0 15px;border-top:1px solid #E2D5C1;"><p style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.35;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 5px;">A somatic warm-up with live piano</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#4A3848;margin:0;">So your nervous system can arrive before anything else happens. Settling, breath widening, listening getting finer.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:14px 0 15px;border-top:1px solid #E2D5C1;"><p style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.35;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 5px;">Guided sounding</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#4A3848;margin:0;">A somatic practice of giving what&rsquo;s here a sound. Not describing it: sounding it.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:14px 0 15px;border-top:1px solid #E2D5C1;"><p style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.35;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 5px;">A first tool for everyday life</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#4A3848;margin:0;">Something to keep coming back to, when something in you is stuck, when your head is too loud, when the day has made you shut down.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr>
<tr><td class="pad" style="padding:26px 44px 0;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color:#4A2540;border-radius:4px;"><tr><td class="pad" style="padding:34px 36px 32px;"><p style="margin:0 0 14px;font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2.5px;color:#E7C9B8;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;">The workshop &middot; 50% off</p><h2 class="offer-h" style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:29px;line-height:1.2;color:#F4ECDF;margin:0 0 14px;">Seventy minutes, live on Zoom</h2><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#EADFCB;margin:0 0 18px;">An introduction to Somatic Vocal Healing, a somatic warm-up with live piano, guided sounding, and a first tool for everyday life. Your microphone stays off unless you want it on. The replay is included.</p><p style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-size:30px;line-height:1.2;color:#F4ECDF;margin:0;"><span style="font-size:19px;color:#C9B4C3;text-decoration:line-through;">&euro;22</span>&nbsp; &euro;11<span style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#C9B4C3;"> </span></p><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:22px 0 12px;"><tr><td style="background-color:#F4ECDF;border-radius:32px;"><a href="https://songdance.co/workshop?utm_source=broadcast&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=bfcm_2026&amp;utm_content=a-new1_cta&amp;{{prefill}}#register" style="display:inline-block;font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.3px;color:#4A2540;padding:15px 32px;text-decoration:none;">Choose a date &rarr;</a></td></tr></table><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#C9B4C3;margin:0;">The price is already on the page, in your own currency. No code needed.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr>
<tr><td class="pad" style="padding:26px 44px 0;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color:#4A2540;border-radius:4px;"><tr><td class="pad" style="padding:34px 36px 32px;"><p style="margin:0 0 14px;font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2.5px;color:#E7C9B8;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;">The masterclass &middot; 50% off</p><h2 class="offer-h" style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:29px;line-height:1.2;color:#F4ECDF;margin:0 0 14px;">A hundred minutes, for those who work with people</h2><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#EADFCB;margin:0 0 18px;">For therapists, coaches, bodyworkers, teachers and anyone who holds space. First you feel the practice in your own body. Then how it works, your role while someone sounds, and where it fits in your work, and where it doesn&rsquo;t.</p><p style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-size:30px;line-height:1.2;color:#F4ECDF;margin:0;"><span style="font-size:19px;color:#C9B4C3;text-decoration:line-through;">&euro;44</span>&nbsp; &euro;22<span style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#C9B4C3;"> </span></p><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:22px 0 12px;"><tr><td style="background-color:#F4ECDF;border-radius:32px;"><a href="https://songdance.co/courses/masterclass?utm_source=broadcast&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=bfcm_2026&amp;utm_content=a-new1_cta&amp;{{prefill}}#register" style="display:inline-block;font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.3px;color:#4A2540;padding:15px 32px;text-decoration:none;">See the masterclass dates &rarr;</a></td></tr></table><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#C9B4C3;margin:0;">The price is already on the page, in your own currency. No code needed.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr>
<tr><td class="pad" style="padding:34px 44px 42px;"><p style="font-family:''Cormorant Garamond'',Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;font-size:20px;line-height:1.5;color:#4A3848;margin:0 0 28px;">With love,<br>Jacob</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#4A3848;margin:0;"><strong style="font-weight:600;color:#2A1B2A;">P.S.</strong> Any date on the page counts, also one in a few weeks. What matters is that you register before Monday night.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td class="pad" style="background-color:#EADFCB;padding:32px 44px 34px;"><img src="https://songdance.co/brand/logo-wordmark-dark.png" width="130" alt="Songdance" style="width:130px;height:auto;margin:0 0 18px;"><p style="font-family:''Cormorant Garamond'',Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#7A6A78;margin:0 0 18px;">The sound was always yours.</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;color:#7A6A78;margin:0 0 6px;">Three emails about this, the last one on Monday. Not for you? <a href="{{ unsubscribe_url }}" style="color:#7A6A78;text-decoration:underline;">Unsubscribe</a> and you won&rsquo;t hear from this list again.</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;color:#9A8A78;margin:0;">Songdance BV &middot; Beaupréstraat 13, 8310 Bruges, Belgium<br>BE0743575076</p></td></tr>
</table>
</td></tr>
</table>
</body>
