       body_text = 'Hello {{ subscriber.first_name | default: "there" }},

You have sounded with us, in a workshop or a masterclass. One hour is enough to find out that the voice knows things the mind hasn''t caught up with yet.

It is not enough to make it yours. That takes a while, and a map: fear, anger, grief, joy, the flat days when nothing seems to be there, the old wounds. One at a time, at your own tempo.

That is the 12-week course. After a workshop it is usually 20% off for two days. From today through Monday 30 November it is 50% off, and so is the certification path, for those who want to hold space for others one day.


AFTER TWELVE WEEKS, YOU CAN

- Find and sound a stuck feeling: instead of mentally trying to manage it, or waiting for it to pass.
- Work with your nervous system: not against it.
- Hear what your voice is telling you: fear, anger, grief, purpose, even older echoes.
- Hold a steady, grounded space for sounding: first for yourself, eventually for others.
- Keep practising on your own: for life.


THE 12-WEEK COURSE, 50% OFF: EUR 275 instead of EUR 550
18+ hours of video across 12 modules, twelve weeks of weekly live Q&As with me, a student community, lifetime access to the materials. The monthly plans are half price too.
https://songdance.co/courses/12-week?utm_source=broadcast&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=bfcm_2026&utm_content=b-workshop1_text&{{prefill}}#register

THE CERTIFICATION PATH, 50% OFF: EUR 670 instead of EUR 1,347
The 12-week course, then the nine-month certification course: class library and manuals, weekly Q&As and a monthly deepening session, Practice Together, and the way to becoming a certified practitioner. The monthly plans are half price too.
https://songdance.co/courses/certification?utm_source=broadcast&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=bfcm_2026&utm_content=b-workshop1_text&{{prefill}}#register

(The prices are already on the pages, in your own currency. No code needed.)

With love,
Jacob

P.S. Questions about which one fits? Reply to this email. A person answers, plainly. If it''s not for you, we''ll say so.

--
Three emails about this, the last one on Monday.
Not for you? Unsubscribe: {{ unsubscribe_url }}
Songdance BV, Beaupréstraat 13, 8310 Bruges, Belgium
'
 WHERE name = 'BFCM B1 · Fri 27 Nov · first notice · workshop or masterclass, no course yet' AND status = 'draft';

