helm. Hearing what the voice is almost saying.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:14px 0 15px;border-top:1px solid #E2D5C1;"><p style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.35;color:#2A1B2A;margin:0 0 5px;">Skills for holding the space</p><p style="font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#4A3848;margin:0;">Pacing. Regulation. The volume button. Knowing when to lead, when to hold, and when to let the silence do the work.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr>
