       body_text = 'Hello {{ subscriber.first_name | default: "there" }},

You did the 12-week course. The materials are still yours, and I hope a tone still finds its way out now and then, in the kitchen or the parked car.

What ended is the live part: the weekly hour together, the questions, hearing each other. Sounding alone is one thing. Being heard changes the sound.

You can come back for just one month. Feel the connection and the aliveness of the community again, ask your questions, share your sound in a Q&A, or simply get back to the practice. And join a live deepening session with me.

Through Monday 30 November there are two ways back in, both at a price I don''t usually offer.


WHAT THE CERTIFICATION COURSE HOLDS

- The complete class library: Every module with a detailed written manual, self-paced from the moment you join.
- A live Q&A every week, for nine months: A live hour with me, and on some weeks with Karen Evans, co-facilitator on the course.
- A two-hour deepening session every month: With the wider community of practitioners, every one recorded into the library.
- Practice Together: Sessions to give and receive with fellow students. The quiet heart of the course.
- The SVH app: To record and revisit your own sounds, train your ear, and keep practising between sessions.
- My feedback on your session: When you apply for certification you send a video of a session you lead, and I answer it personally.


THE CERTIFICATION COURSE, 50% OFF: EUR 395 instead of EUR 797
The class library and manuals, nine months of weekly Q&As and a monthly deepening session, Practice Together, the SVH app, and the way to becoming a certified practitioner. You already have the foundation, so you take it on its own. The monthly plans are half price too.
https://songdance.co/courses/certification?utm_source=broadcast&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=bfcm_2026&utm_content=c-12w-ended1_text&{{prefill}}#register

THE LIVE PASS, 20% OFF
The weekly Q&A, one live hour, and the monthly deepening session, two hours on one theme.
1 month (4 Q&As, 1 deepening session): EUR 41 instead of EUR 52
3 months (12 Q&As, 3 deepening sessions): EUR 105 instead of EUR 132
6 months (24 Q&As, 6 deepening sessions): EUR 187 instead of EUR 234
12 months (48 Q&As, 12 deepening sessions): EUR 348 instead of EUR 436
Monthly, cancel any time: EUR 41.60 the first month, EUR 35.20 the second (20% off both), then EUR 44 a month
A pass starts the day you buy it.
https://songdance.co/courses/live-pass?utm_source=broadcast&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=bfcm_2026&utm_content=c-12w-ended1_text&{{prefill}}#lp-buy-title

(The prices are already on the pages, in your own currency. No code needed.)

With love,
Jacob

P.S. Not sure which? The pass brings back the live sessions, for one month or a whole year. The certification course brings them back for nine months and teaches you to hold space for someone else.

--
Three emails about this, the last one on Monday.
Not for you? Unsubscribe: {{ unsubscribe_url }}
Songdance BV, Beaupréstraat 13, 8310 Bruges, Belgium
'
 WHERE name = 'BFCM C1 · Fri 27 Nov · first notice · 12-week course finished, no certification' AND status = 'draft';

