       body_text = 'Hello {{ subscriber.first_name | default: "there" }},

You are in the second half of the 12-week course. In a few weeks the weekly Q&As stop for you. The materials stay yours for life; the live hour is what ends.

If you would like to keep going after week twelve, this weekend is a good moment to decide. Through Monday 30 November there are two ways, both discounted, and neither overlaps with the weeks you still have.


WHAT THE CERTIFICATION COURSE HOLDS

- The complete class library: Every module with a detailed written manual, self-paced from the moment you join.
- A live Q&A every week, for nine months: A live hour with me, and on some weeks with Karen Evans, co-facilitator on the course.
- A two-hour deepening session every month: With the wider community of practitioners, every one recorded into the library.
- Practice Together: Sessions to give and receive with fellow students. The quiet heart of the course.
- The SVH app: To record and revisit your own sounds, train your ear, and keep practising between sessions.
- My feedback on your session: When you apply for certification you send a video of a session you lead, and I answer it personally.


THE CERTIFICATION COURSE, 50% OFF: EUR 395 instead of EUR 797
The class library and manuals, nine months of weekly Q&As and a monthly deepening session, Practice Together, the SVH app, and the way to becoming a certified practitioner. It begins when your 12 weeks are over, so nothing overlaps. The monthly plans are half price too.
https://songdance.co/courses/certification?utm_source=broadcast&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=bfcm_2026&utm_content=d-12w-late1_text&{{prefill}}#register

THE LIVE PASS, 20% OFF
The weekly Q&A, one live hour, and the monthly deepening session, two hours on one theme.
1 month (4 Q&As, 1 deepening session): EUR 41 instead of EUR 52
3 months (12 Q&As, 3 deepening sessions): EUR 105 instead of EUR 132
6 months (24 Q&As, 6 deepening sessions): EUR 187 instead of EUR 234
12 months (48 Q&As, 12 deepening sessions): EUR 348 instead of EUR 436
Monthly, cancel any time: EUR 41.60 the first month, EUR 35.20 the second (20% off both), then EUR 44 a month
It starts the day after your course''s live sessions end, so you pay for nothing twice.
https://songdance.co/courses/live-pass?utm_source=broadcast&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=bfcm_2026&utm_content=d-12w-late1_text&{{prefill}}#lp-buy-title

(The prices are already on the pages, in your own currency. No code needed.)

With love,
Jacob

P.S. And if twelve weeks turns out to be exactly enough, that is a fine answer. This is a tool, not a destination.

--
Three emails about this, the last one on Monday.
Not for you? Unsubscribe: {{ unsubscribe_url }}
Songdance BV, Beaupréstraat 13, 8310 Bruges, Belgium
