       body_text = 'Hello {{ subscriber.first_name | default: "there" }},

This is my last note about it.

Tonight the certification course goes back to EUR 797 and the live passes to their usual price. Whatever you choose, your 12 weeks go on exactly as they are.


A SMALL WAY, AND A LARGER ONE

A month of live sessions is a small way to keep going after week twelve. Nine months of training is a larger one. Neither changes anything in the weeks you still have.


THE CERTIFICATION COURSE, 50% OFF: EUR 395 instead of EUR 797
The class library and manuals, nine months of weekly Q&As and a monthly deepening session, Practice Together, the SVH app, and the way to becoming a certified practitioner. It begins when your 12 weeks are over, so nothing overlaps. The monthly plans are half price too.
https://songdance.co/courses/certification?utm_source=broadcast&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=bfcm_2026&utm_content=d-12w-late3_text&{{prefill}}#register

THE LIVE PASS, 20% OFF
The weekly Q&A, one live hour, and the monthly deepening session, two hours on one theme.
1 month (4 Q&As, 1 deepening session): EUR 41 instead of EUR 52
3 months (12 Q&As, 3 deepening sessions): EUR 105 instead of EUR 132
6 months (24 Q&As, 6 deepening sessions): EUR 187 instead of EUR 234
12 months (48 Q&As, 12 deepening sessions): EUR 348 instead of EUR 436
Monthly, cancel any time: EUR 41.60 the first month, EUR 35.20 the second (20% off both), then EUR 44 a month
It starts the day after your course''s live sessions end, so you pay for nothing twice.
https://songdance.co/courses/live-pass?utm_source=broadcast&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=bfcm_2026&utm_content=d-12w-late3_text&{{prefill}}#lp-buy-title

(The prices are already on the pages, in your own currency. No code needed.)

See you in the Q&A,
Jacob

P.S. Tonight means the end of Monday, wherever you are.

--
Three emails about this, the last one on Monday.
Not for you? Unsubscribe: {{ unsubscribe_url }}
Songdance BV, Beaupréstraat 13, 8310 Bruges, Belgium
